# Next.js maintains tsconfig.json and rewrites the whole file when it changes
# one thing in it, in its own formatting. The file is committed in that shape so
# a dev server has nothing to rewrite, which means Prettier has to keep its
# hands off it or the two would take turns reformatting it forever.
